OL,3,GNEWSATax return backlog much bigger
OL,4,Athan thought
OL,5,
OL,6,FA backlog of tax returns and other
OL,7,Frevenue documents is much larger than
OL,8,Finitially thought, a report has found.
OL,10,FPreviously the States of Guernsey was
OL,11,Ftold there were 20,000 backlogged tax
OL,12,Freturns as the island's Revenue Service
OL,13,Fstruggled to keep up with demand.
OL,15,FHowever, a report from the service has
OL,16,Fhighlighted there were 106,444
OL,17,Foutstanding work items - including tax
OL,18,Fassessments, repayments and bereavement
OL,19,Fcases - at the end of August.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
