OL,3,GNEWSATax return backlog much bigger
OL,4,Athan thought
OL,5,
OL,6,FJean Mehers, director of the Revenue
OL,7,FService operations, apologised for the
OL,8,Ffrustration and uncertainty caused by
OL,9,Fthe backlog, which had built up over 12
OL,10,Fyears.
